I asked about the screen capture fuction myself, and it seems that it's
actualy a patch for nethack that you have to work into it right during
compile.

The good news is you don't need it if you are playing the ascii version
under windows. First if you aren't running it in a window and are
running it full screen press alt+enter

Once you have it in a window press your print screen button. Now open
up note pad and press ctrl+v

There you go screen dumped. (if the characters don't line up correctly
you need to highlight all the text and change the font to something
like courier new)


